<h1 class="sr-only">Manifesto</h1>
<div class="body">
  <p>There is a group of uniquely gifted and hungry students at UVA already building and making impact right now. We are now ready to resource them.</p>
  <p>Higher education, especially at UVA, is struggling to equip its brightest students with the training, tools, and network needed to aim higher.</p>
  <p>There is no reason that the next billion dollar company should not come from the talent-dense &amp; resourced students here.</p>
  <p>The university is failing to teach the importance of AI and bring in the right voices to guide the next wave of students in the AI economy.</p>
  <p>There is one certainty about windows of opportunity: they close. Today, there is an open window and we are ready to take it.</p>
  <p>We have built a community of like-minded &amp; ambitious students through inviting and hosting founders who share their experiences and challenge our group to aim higher.</p>
  <p>We are now ready to take on our founding investment and to equip our first cohort with the means to build and create.</p>
  <p>We know that with the right guidance, there is nothing that students can't achieve. The founders of our organization can be taken as an initial case study. Our founding team has each felt the challenges of launching ventures, working full-time during school, and maintaining excellence with their social and academic conduct at UVA.</p>
  <p>We plan to do a single cohort per semester. Each cohort will be 5-7 students only.</p>
  <p>The goal of a cohort is to connect students with the brightest minds, provide resources and guidance to set students on the right path to do their life's work, starting with their time at UVA.</p>
  <p>To start with, each member will get a small grant and a founding member who mentors them closely. Every week the cohort meets for a check-in and dinner, where each member must present a tangible outcome achieved in the last 7 days.</p>
  <p>By the end of each cohort we hope to have progressed the career of each member in a tangible and measurable manner.</p>
  <p>Builders is a non-profit, we take no equity. We plan to be a 501(c)(3), so donations are tax-deductible. Our backers get a first look at everything the cohort builds and first bid at later investment rounds.</p>
  <p>Every cohort is trained to be capable enough to mentor and take over the next.</p>
</div>

